        "collapsible_tab_UWQ8gk": {
          "type": "collapsible-tab",
          "name": "Overview",
          "settings": {
            "collapsible_tab_heading": "Overview",
            "collapsible_tab_text": "<p>Never shovel another driveway. Never wait on the plow again. The Core and Snow Blower Module clear your driveway, walkways, and estate approaches on their own, through the night, through heavy snowfall, so your property is open, safe, and ready before you've had your coffee.<br/><br/>❄️ Two-stage clearing handles heavy accumulation.<br/>🔋 Auto-docks at 20% battery, recharges in 90 minutes, resumes at 80%.<br/>🌡️ Optional heating modules extend operation down to -40°F.<br/></p>"
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_Uf69Wz": {
          "type": "collapsible-tab",
          "name": "Product Information",
          "settings": {
            "collapsible_tab_heading": "Product Information",
            "collapsible_tab_text": "<p><strong>What Winter Already Costs You</strong></p><p>A seasonal snow-removal contract runs year after year with no end and no asset. Doing it yourself costs you your mornings, and an icy, uncleared walkway is a genuine liability on any property that receives guests, staff, or deliveries. The Yarbo Snow Blower replaces the contract and the labor with one machine you own, working automatically every time it snows.</p><h3>Clears While You Sleep</h3><p>Set it and forget it. The Yarbo Snow Blower works autonomously through the night and heavy snowfall, keeping driveways and paths clear so your property never gets buried and you never lose a morning to it. Two-stage clearing handles the kind of accumulation that stops smaller machines. It auto-docks at 20% battery, recharges in 90 minutes, and resumes at 80%, through the full storm, without any input from you.</p><h3>Precision Navigation, No Boundary Wires</h3><p>The Core maps your property to centimeter accuracy using RTK positioning, vision, and multi-sensor fusion, clearing exactly where it should and staying off beds, borders, and hardscape. No wires to bury, no lines to repaint each season.</p><h3>Built for Real Winter Terrain</h3><p>A tracked drive system and 70% (35°) climbing ability take on sloped driveways and packed snow that stop wheeled machines. Q355 steel construction and IPX5 waterproofing are built for the conditions it was made to work in. With optional heating modules, it operates down to -40°F.</p><h3>One Core. Every Season.</h3><p>The Snow Blower is one module in a modular system. When spring comes, add the Lawn Mower Pro or Leaf Blower module to the same Core. You are never buying a second machine to cover the rest of the year.</p><h3>In the Box</h3><ul><li>Yarbo Core (autonomous tracked base)</li><li>Snow Blower Module</li><li>Smart Battery (1.38 kWh), Docking Station, and accessories</li></ul>"
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_X7L37G": {
          "type": "collapsible-tab",
          "name": "Warranty & Support",
          "settings": {
            "collapsible_tab_heading": "Warranty & Support",
            "collapsible_tab_text": "<p>A 2-year manufacturer warranty on defective parts, extendable up to 5 years, with expert support behind it. Typically delivered in about two weeks after your order. This is a modular system that ships in multiple cartons; freight and delivery details are confirmed at checkout.<br/><br/>Spread the cost over time with flexible financing at checkout through Shop Pay Installments.<br/><br/></p>"
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_HjeTwa": {
          "type": "collapsible-tab",
          "name": "Setup & Installation",
          "settings": {
            "collapsible_tab_heading": "Setup & Installation",
            "collapsible_tab_text": "<p>No boundary wires. The Core maps your property on its first run using RTK positioning, vision, and multi-sensor fusion, and you are supported through setup and beyond.<br/><br/></p>"
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_czbJiW": {
          "type": "collapsible-tab",
          "name": "Specifications",
          "settings": {
            "collapsible_tab_heading": "Specifications",
            "collapsible_tab_text": "<p>Navigation: RTK + Vision + IMU + ODOM<br/><br/>Obstacle avoidance: Binocular camera + ultrasonic radar + bumper<br/><br/>Climbing ability: 70% (35°)<br/><br/>Drive system: Tracked with steel-spiked traction<br/><br/>Battery: 1.38 kWh, 90 min charge, auto-recharge<br/><br/>Connectivity: 4G, Wi-Fi, Bluetooth, Wi-Fi HaLow<br/><br/>Water resistance: IPX5 with rain detection<br/><br/>Construction: Q355 steel<br/><br/>Cold-weather operation: down to -40°F with optional heating modules<br/><br/>Includes: Core, Snow Blower Module, Smart Battery (1.38 kWh), Docking Station, accessories<br/><br/>Warranty: 2 years, extendable up to 5<br/><br/></p>"
          }
        },
